  The reel_script's second-paragraph repeats the Sakthi Vel hometown ('காவக்காடையைச் சேர்ந்தவர்') in a way that mixes his residence with the sale event; this is accurate to the article but placed after the arrest sentences without clear linkage, making the sentence structure ambiguous.
